      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "name": "jlIBB97pY0cLNe-M9_FXg",
        "revealOrder": 1
      },
      "text": "in that more than ninety percent of its material is unique. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "in that more than ninety percent of its material is unique. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zafZoQX48XwjZA6byTbW3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2613.147453988469,
      "y": 19854.232117951662,
      "width": 407.9676818847656,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "WUuao7rr7jiJMvreJqngn",
      "index": "b2zO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 335879621,
      "version": 15,
      "versionNonce": 173151563,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773542283799,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "name": "tymTzUxa-ZKJ0ZPVSkh1i",
        "revealOrder": 2
      },
      "text": "John's Gospel does not focus on the miracles, \nparables, and public speeches that are so prominent \nin the other accounts. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "John's Gospel does not focus on the miracles, \nparables, and public speeches that are so prominent \nin the other accounts. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TZilFaqM9FWM6C9U6E9K2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2613.147453988469,
      "y": 19966.160106313186,
      "width": 453.74359130859375,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "WUuao7rr7jiJMvreJqngn",
      "index": "b2zV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1334254885,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 192739557,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773542283799,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "name": "Xk_PAKc2Gfurh7T5SPpRB",
        "revealOrder": 3
      },
      "text": "Instead, the Gospel of John\nemphasizes the identity of Jesus as the Son of God \nand how we, as believers, should respond to his teachings.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Instead, the Gospel of John\nemphasizes the identity of Jesus as the Son of God \nand how we, as believers, should respond to his teachings.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
